Read the applicable consolidated Annex XX of Portaria de Consolidação 5/2017 together with the amendments identified by the official index, including Portarias 888 and 2.472 of 2021. Locate definitions, responsibilities, control and surveillance, sampling, quality criteria and required responses. Identify the kind of supply and the competent authority before applying a provision.

The official index was checked on 29 October 2026. A webpage update date is not the enactment date, and an isolated historical amendment is not a substitute for the applicable consolidated text. Read the Diário Oficial text and current state/municipal requirements for an actual project. These are jurisdiction-specific primary legal references; the trail does not turn an educational calculation into a compliance finding.

